id: flash-tags
section: Flash
item: An embed, an object with data, an object with a movie param, nested objects and a direct navigation to a movie each draw and take a tap; the detection script reads 10.3
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R4
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
expect text-has detect 10.3
expect text-has detect "mime yes"
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&tag=object
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&tag=param
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&tag=nested
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-plant-rate15.swf
expect flash-rate 0,100,756,1000 3 5 100
